.* WRKSFWAGR and WRKLICINF.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=IDCL BASETYPE='CHAR 7'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=SHORTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=STSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 11'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=RLSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 6'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LINECL BASETYPE='CHAR 76'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=DEVCL BASETYPE='CHAR 21'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ONECL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=LPID CLASS=IDCL.
:VAR NAME=LPOPT CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=STATUS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=LPTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=LPRLS CLASS=RLSCL.
:VAR NAME=LPTYPE CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=INSDEV CLASS=DEVCL.
:VAR NAME=INSOBJ CLASS=ONECL.
:VAR NAME=INSIPL CLASS=ONECL.
:VAR NAME=PRILNG CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=PRILNGT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=LNGID CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=LNGTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=AGRLINE CLASS=LINECL.
:VAR NAME=AGRSTS CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=LICTRM CLASS=RLSCL.
:VAR NAME=LICFTR CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=LICCMP CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=LICLMT CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=LICCNT CLASS=SHORTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=INSTALLED VARS='LPID LPOPT STATUS LPTEXT LPRLS'.
:LISTDEF NAME=PROGRAMS VARS='OPT LPID LPOPT STATUS LPTEXT LPRLS'.
:LISTDEF NAME=LANGS VARS='OPT LNGID LNGTEXT'.
:LISTDEF NAME=AGRTEXT VARS='AGRLINE'.
:LISTDEF NAME=AGRS VARS='OPT LPID LPRLS AGRSTS LPTEXT'.
:LISTDEF NAME=LICS VARS='OPT LPID LICTRM LICFTR LICCMP LICLMT LICCNT'.
:KEYL NAME=DSPKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11'.F11=Display release
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F19 ACTION='RETURN 19'.F19=Display trademarks
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=RLSKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11'.F11=Display status
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F19 ACTION='RETURN 19'.F19=Display trademarks
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=SELKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11'.F11=Display release
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F19 ACTION='RETURN 19'.F19=Display trademarks
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=PRMKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=AGRKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F14 ACTION='RETURN 14'.F14=Accept
:KEYI KEY=F15 ACTION='RETURN 15'.F15=Decline
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=WRKKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=LICPGM10 HELP=HLP10 KEYL=DSPKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Installed Licensed Programs
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=INSTALLED SCROLL=YES HEADSEP.(No licensed programs are installed)
:LISTCOL VAR=LPID USAGE=OUTPUT.Licensed Program
:LISTCOL VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT.Installed Status
:LISTCOL VAR=LPTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=44.Description
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=LICPGM10R HELP=HLP10 KEYL=RLSKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Installed Licensed Programs
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=INSTALLED SCROLL=YES HEADSEP.(No licensed programs are installed)
:LISTCOL VAR=LPID USAGE=OUTPUT.Licensed Program
:LISTCOL VAR=LPRLS USAGE=OUTPUT.Installed Release
:LISTCOL VAR=LPOPT USAGE=OUTPUT.Product Option
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=LICPGM11 HELP=HLP11 KEYL=SELKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Install Licensed Programs
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=PROGRAMS SCROLL=YES HEADSEP.(No licensed programs to install)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='RETURN 101'.1=Install
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=LPID USAGE=OUTPUT.Licensed Program
:LISTCOL VAR=LPOPT USAGE=OUTPUT.Product Option
:LISTCOL VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT.Installed Status
:LISTCOL VAR=LPTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=36.Description
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=LICINSOPT HELP=HLPINS KEYL=PRMKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Install Options
:TOPINST.Type choices, press Enter.
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATAI VAR=INSDEV USAGE=INOUT.Installation device (save file)
:DATAI VAR=INSOBJ USAGE=INOUT.Objects to install
:DATAI VAR=INSIPL USAGE=INOUT.Automatic IPL
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Objects: 1=Programs and language objects, 2=Programs, 3=Language objects
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=LICAGREE HELP=HLPAGR KEYL=AGRKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Software Agreement
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATAI VAR=LPID USAGE=OUTPUT.Licensed program
:DATAI VAR=LPRLS USAGE=OUTPUT.Release
:DATAI VAR=LPTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Description
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=AGRTEXT SCROLL=YES.
:LISTCOL VAR=AGRLINE USAGE=OUTPUT.
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.F14 accepts the agreement; F15 declines it and the program is not installed.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=LICPGM12 HELP=HLP12 KEYL=SELKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Delete Licensed Programs
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=PROGRAMS SCROLL=YES HEADSEP.(No licensed programs are installed)
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD DLTLICPGM LICPGM(&LPID.) OPTION(&LPOPT.)'.4=Delete
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=LPID USAGE=OUTPUT.Licensed Program
:LISTCOL VAR=LPOPT USAGE=OUTPUT.Product Option
:LISTCOL VAR=LPTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=44.Description
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=LICPGM13 HELP=HLP13 KEYL=SELKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Save Licensed Programs
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=PROGRAMS SCROLL=YES HEADSEP.(No licensed programs are installed)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='CMD ?SAVLICPGM LICPGM(&LPID.) OPTION(&LPOPT.) DEV(*SAVF)'.1=Save
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=LPID USAGE=OUTPUT.Licensed Program
:LISTCOL VAR=LPOPT USAGE=OUTPUT.Product Option
:LISTCOL VAR=LPTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=44.Description
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=LICLNG20 HELP=HLPLNG KEYL=PRMKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Secondary Languages
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAI VAR=PRILNG USAGE=OUTPUT.Primary language
:DATAI VAR=PRILNGT USAGE=OUTPUT.Description
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=LANGS SCROLL=YES HEADSEP.(No secondary languages are installed)
:LISTCOL VAR=LNGID USAGE=OUTPUT.Secondary Language
:LISTCOL VAR=LNGTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Description
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=LICLNG21 HELP=HLPLNG KEYL=PRMKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Install Secondary Languages
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATAI VAR=PRILNG USAGE=OUTPUT.Primary language
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=LANGS SCROLL=YES HEADSEP.(No other languages are on the media)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='RETURN 121'.1=Install
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=LNGID USAGE=OUTPUT.Language Feature
:LISTCOL VAR=LNGTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Description
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=LICLNG22 HELP=HLPLNG KEYL=PRMKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Delete Secondary Languages
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATAI VAR=PRILNG USAGE=OUTPUT.Primary language
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=LANGS SCROLL=YES HEADSEP.(No secondary languages are installed)
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='RETURN 122'.4=Delete
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=LNGID USAGE=OUTPUT.Secondary Language
:LISTCOL VAR=LNGTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Description
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKSFWAGR HELP=HLPWAGR KEYL=WRKKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Software Agreements
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=AGRS SCROLL=YES HEADSEP.(No software agreements)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 105'.5=Display
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=LPID USAGE=OUTPUT.Licensed Program
:LISTCOL VAR=LPRLS USAGE=OUTPUT.Release
:LISTCOL VAR=AGRSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=LPTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=38.Description
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKLICINF HELP=HLPWLIC KEYL=WRKKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with License Information
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=LICS SCROLL=YES HEADSEP.(No license information)
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD ?CHGLICINF PRDID(&LPID.) LICTRM(&LICTRM.) FEATURE(&LICFTR.)'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD DSPLICKEY PRDID(&LPID.) LICTRM(&LICTRM.) FEATURE(&LICFTR.)'.5=Display license key
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=LPID USAGE=OUTPUT.Product ID
:LISTCOL VAR=LICTRM USAGE=OUTPUT.Term
:LISTCOL VAR=LICFTR USAGE=OUTPUT.Feature
:LISTCOL VAR=LICCMP USAGE=OUTPUT.Compliance
:LISTCOL VAR=LICLMT USAGE=OUTPUT.Usage Limit
:LISTCOL VAR=LICCNT USAGE=OUTPUT.Usage Count
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLP10.Display Installed Licensed Programs - Help
:P.Each licensed program option installed on the system, with its
installed status: *COMPATIBLE when it is right for this release of the
operating system, *ERROR when a load is not completely installed,
*NOPRIMARY when its primary language objects are missing.
:P.F11 shows the installed release and the product option instead.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLP11.Install Licensed Programs - Help
:P.Type 1 next to each licensed program option to install, then press
Enter. The install options come next, then each product's software
agreement, which must be accepted before the product is installed.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPINS.Install Options - Help
:P.The installation device is the save file holding the product loads,
as LIBRARY/FILE, until optical and tape media are supported.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPAGR.Software Agreement - Help
:P.Read the agreement. F14 accepts it and the install goes on; F15
declines it and the product is not installed.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLP12.Delete Licensed Programs - Help
:P.Type 4 next to each licensed program option to delete. Deleting the
base option deletes every option of the product.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLP13.Save Licensed Programs - Help
:P.Type 1 next to each licensed program option to save into a save
file for installing on another system.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPLNG.Secondary Languages - Help
:P.The language features installed besides the primary language.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPWAGR.Work with Software Agreements - Help
:P.The software agreement of each installed product and whether it was
accepted. Option 5 shows the agreement.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPWLIC.Work with License Information - Help
:P.The license terms of each product feature: how use past the usage
limit is handled, the limit and the uses held now.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
